<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CST started as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CST started as outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Securities analyst Eveline Freire Gerck started coverage of Brazilian steel firm Companhia Siderurgica de Tubarao SA, or CST, Monday with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;By 1998 we expect CST to rank among the top 25 steel mills in the world in terms of profitability and cost efficiency,&quot; she wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- She set a target price of $21 per 1,000 local preferred class B shares over the next six to 10 months, a potential appreciation of 28 percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
